name: SecurityAudit
description: "Perform a comprehensive security audit of a specific code repository."

allowed_data:
  - Code Repositories
  - Security Policies
  - Known Vulnerabilities Database

allowed_tools:
  - Code Analyzer
  - Dependency Checker
  - Internal Search

forbidden:
  - Modification of code
  - Internet Access
  - Execution of untrusted code

validation:
  - All findings must reference specific lines of code
  - Vulnerability scores must be verified

output: Security_Audit_Report.md
risk_level: HIGH
